# Cross-frontend agent-rule fanout generated by the `caveman` plugin
# (see docs/decisions.org ADR-023). Claude Code is this repo's one agentic
# frontend, so only its own copy — the block in AGENTS.md — is tracked; these
# are regenerable output for editors this config doesn't use.
/.clinerules/
/.cursor/
/.opencode/
/.windsurf/

# Same fanout, but .github/ itself stays usable for real repo infrastructure
# (workflows, issue templates — issues live on Meta-James/doom-config).
/.github/copilot-instructions.md
